{"content":[{"c":["DAVID*, Root of"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Phrase applied to Jesus Christ in the book of Revelation (",{"href":"?bref=Rev.5.5","r":"Rev.5.5","rawR":"Rev.5.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.5.5","value":"Rev.5.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Rv 5:5"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.22.16","r":"Rev.22.16","rawR":"Rev.22.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.22.16","value":"Rev.22.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"22:16"},"). Though “root” usually means “source,” the metaphor depicts Jesus as David’s royal descendant, as indicated by the parallel word “offspring” in ",{"href":"?bref=Rev.22.16","r":"Rev.22.16","rawR":"Rev.22.16","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Rev.22.16","value":"Rev.22.16"}],"t":"ref","v":"Revelation 22:16"},". That is, Jesus came from King David’s family as a branch grows from a rooted tree (cf. ",{"href":"?bref=Isa.11.1","r":"Isa.11.1","rawR":"Isa.11.1","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.11.1","value":"Isa.11.1"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 11:1"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=JesseRootof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"JesseRootof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"JesseRootof_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Jesse, Root of"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"DavidRootof","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Rv 5:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.5.5","rawQueryValue":"Rev.5.5","sourceRefExact":"Rev.5.5"},{"anchorText":"22:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.22.16","rawQueryValue":"Rev.22.16","sourceRefExact":"Rev.22.16"},{"anchorText":"Revelation 22:16","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Rev.22.16","rawQueryValue":"Rev.22.16","sourceRefExact":"Rev.22.16"},{"anchorText":"Is 11:1","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.11.1","rawQueryValue":"Isa.11.1","sourceRefExact":"Isa.11.1"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"77ae7cc4b8e76fc784895fe7f150e8d78de3ccd470afb446659c42e51c857b47","sourceItemName":"DavidRootof","sourceItemOrder":37,"sourceMember":"Articles/D.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"DavidRootof","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"David*, Root of","title":"David*, Root of","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}